  dialogueText: 
  dialogue:
  - isPlayer: 0
    text: Who you are? More like what you are.
  - isPlayer: 0
    text: You are a Demigod of course, One mortal parent and one Godly parent.
  - isPlayer: 1
    text: It can't be, there are no such things.
  - isPlayer: 0
    text: I assure you there are, now carefull before you go on their bad side.
  - isPlayer: 0
    text: I assure you there are, now carefull before you go on their bad side.
  - isPlayer: 0
    text: You are actually they, there are 2 of you in this body.
  - isPlayer: 0
    text: Something happened that binded your bodies together.
